    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7d0e8d5d219e0594ef8d7d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使现在看来只是些平常小事，\n长大以后，回忆也一定会成为\n推动我前进的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed56b174243faa8ab448ef11746d38c70d1a020beaa38cb526671a7cb75c572d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
