    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e06f000e242dbc1faac428bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唯有现在能做的事，就在此刻去做。\n我下定决心要以训练员的身份\n竭尽所能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42b3c29815edf867ec84651aea75d92dc188e2b3502faecbcda36709a2d1cb25",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110515.json",
      "json_path": [
