      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然，我每天都会记录训练和比赛结果。\n但未来到来时，\n也需要能唤起此刻记忆的物品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3f16547d186dec550f4b1bca5f3c704b7df2891afb6914a5ecdb0f734e95d87",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110515.json",
      "json_path": [
